# Title: Repository Git Attribute Policy
# Introduction:
# Defines canonical line endings, marks binaries, and protects governed
# corpus bytes so Windows and Linux checkouts stay byte-stable where required.
#
# Created by: Rafat Al Khashan
# Created date: 2026-07-15
# Last modified: 2026-07-30

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Default: detect text, normalize to LF in the repository
# Working trees on Windows still receive LF (eol=lf) to match CI/Linux.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

